---
import MBPRLayout from "../layouts/MBPRLayout.astro";
---
<MBPRLayout title="Contact | Mission Bay Puppy Rescue" description="Get in touch with Mission Bay Puppy Rescue — find the right form for adoption, fostering, surrender, or general questions.">
<section class="page-intro">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="eyebrow">Let&rsquo;s Get You To The Right Place</span>
    <h1>Contact Mission Bay Puppy Rescue</h1>
    <p class="lede">Choose what best matches why you&rsquo;re reaching out &mdash; most people find their answer before ever needing the general form below.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section tight">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="route-grid">
      <a class="route-tile" href="/adopt">
      <div class="icon-badge"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 11.5L12 4l8 7.5"/><path d="M6 10v9h12v-9"/><path d="M10 19v-5h4v5"/></svg></div>
      <h4>I Want To Adopt</h4>
      <p>Check the FAQ, then start your application.</p>
      <span class="link-quiet">Go &rarr;</span>
    </a>
<a class="route-tile" href="/foster">
      <div class="icon-badge"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 20s-7.5-4.6-9.5-9C1 7.5 3 4 6.5 4c2 0 3.4 1.2 4 2 .6-.8 2-2 4-2C18 4 20 7.5 18.5 11c-2 4.4-6.5 9-6.5 9z"/></svg></div>
      <h4>I Want To Foster</h4>
      <p>See what fostering involves and apply.</p>
      <span class="link-quiet">Go &rarr;</span>
    </a>
<a class="route-tile" href="/relinquishment">
      <div class="icon-badge"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="6" y="4.5" width="12" height="16" rx="1.5"/><rect x="9" y="3" width="6" height="3" rx="1"/><path d="M9 11h6M9 14.5h6M9 17.5h3.5"/></svg></div>
      <h4>I Need To Surrender A Dog</h4>
      <p>Fill out the relinquishment form.</p>
      <span class="link-quiet">Go &rarr;</span>
    </a>
<a class="route-tile" href="/resources#partners">
      <div class="icon-badge"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="10.5" cy="10.5" r="6.5"/><path d="M15.5 15.5L21 21"/></svg></div>
      <h4>I Found A Stray</h4>
      <p>Get instructions and local resources.</p>
      <span class="link-quiet">Go &rarr;</span>
    </a>
<a class="route-tile" href="#general-form">
      <div class="icon-badge"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3.5" y="5" width="17" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="M8 3v4M16 3v4M3.5 10h17"/></svg></div>
      <h4>Request Puppies At An Event</h4>
      <p>Tell us about your event.</p>
      <span class="link-quiet">Go &rarr;</span>
    </a>
<a class="route-tile" href="#general-form">
      <div class="icon-badge"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3.5" y="8" width="17" height="11" rx="1.5"/><path d="M8 8V6a2 2 0 012-2h4a2 2 0 012 2v2"/><path d="M3.5 13h17"/></svg></div>
      <h4>Corporate / Product Partnership</h4>
      <p>Tell us about your proposal.</p>
      <span class="link-quiet">Go &rarr;</span>
    </a>
<a class="route-tile" href="/donate">
      <div class="icon-badge"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="4" y="9" width="16" height="11" rx="1.2"/><path d="M4 13h16"/><path d="M12 9v11"/><path d="M12 9C10.5 9 8.5 8 8.5 6.2 8.5 5 9.4 4 10.6 4c1.6 0 1.9 2.5 1.4 5zM12 9c1.5 0 3.5-1 3.5-2.8 0-1.2-.9-2.2-2.1-2.2-1.6 0-1.9 2.5-1.4 5z"/></svg></div>
      <h4>I Want To Donate</h4>
      <p>Give once or set up a monthly gift.</p>
      <span class="link-quiet">Go &rarr;</span>
    </a>
<a class="route-tile" href="/faq">
      <div class="icon-badge"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 5.5C6 4.4 9 4 12 5.2 15 4 18 4.4 20 5.5v13c-2-1.1-5-1.5-8-.3-3-1.2-6-.8-8 .3z"/><path d="M12 5.2v13"/></svg></div>
      <h4>I Have Another Question</h4>
      <p>Check the FAQ first.</p>
      <span class="link-quiet">Go &rarr;</span>
    </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section sand-deep" id="general-form">
  <div class="container" style="max-width:640px;">
    <span class="eyebrow" style="justify-content:center; display:flex;">Something Else?</span>
    <h2 style="text-align:center;">General Contact Form</h2>
    <p class="lede" style="text-align:center; margin:0 auto 26px;">If none of the options above fit, send us a message and we&rsquo;ll get back to you as soon as we can.</p>
    <div style="background:var(--white); border:1px solid var(--sand-line); border-radius:var(--radius-lg); box-shadow:var(--shadow-md); padding:30px;">
      <div style="display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:16px;">
        <div>
          <label style="font-family:var(--font-display); font-size:.78rem; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.05em; opacity:.7;">Name</label>
          <div style="margin-top:6px; border:1px solid var(--sand-line); border-radius:10px; height:46px; background:var(--sand);"></div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <label style="font-family:var(--font-display); font-size:.78rem; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.05em; opacity:.7;">Email</label>
          <div style="margin-top:6px; border:1px solid var(--sand-line); border-radius:10px; height:46px; background:var(--sand);"></div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <label style="font-family:var(--font-display); font-size:.78rem; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.05em; opacity:.7;">Message</label>
          <div style="margin-top:6px; border:1px solid var(--sand-line); border-radius:10px; height:110px; background:var(--sand);"></div>
        </div>
        <a class="btn btn-gold btn-block" href="#">Send Message</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p style="text-align:center; opacity:.6; font-size:.85rem; margin-top:18px;">You&rsquo;ll get an automatic reply confirming we received your message, with quick links to Available Pups, Apply, Foster, FAQ, and Relinquishment. [DRAFT &mdash; auto-reply wording pending]<span class="draft-flag">Content Needed</span></p>
  </div>
</section>
</MBPRLayout>